# Core (Workspace)

**Extends**: `@system.mdc`. **Portable slice** (logging invariant, code style,
workflow gates) lives in `rule:engineering-conduct` — this file carries only
the cursor/gateway-environment-local remainder.

## Environment
| Venv | PYTHONPATH | Import |
|---|---|---|
| `$HOME/.venvs/universal` (Python 3.12) | `libs/` via `sitecustomize.py` | `from process_ipc.core import ...` |

## `tmp/` — Ephemeral
**Invariant**: ¬persist across sessions, ¬commit. `tmp/prompts/`: specs/handoffs. `tmp/summaries/` / `/tmp/summaries/`: lead-seat scratch only — ¬ cursor-sdk dispatch deliverables (durable shares per packet). ∀ durable knowledge → the two shares: `cortex://` (`fs(sandbox="cortex", …)`, backed by `/mnt/torus/mcp-data`) ∨ `workspaces://` (`fs(sandbox="workspaces", …)`, backed by `/mnt/torus/projects` — `tasks/journal/`, `docs/`, `.cursor/rules/`, source).

